### Créer un véhicule (1)
POST http://localhost:8089/api/vehicules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "immatriculation": "123 TUN 4567",
  "marque": "Renault",
  "modele": "Clio",
  "categorie": "CITADINE",
  "tarifJournalier": 80.0,
  "statut": "DISPONIBLE"
}

### Créer un véhicule (2)
POST http://localhost:8089/api/vehicules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "immatriculation": "205 TUN 8812",
  "marque": "Peugeot",
  "modele": "508",
  "categorie": "BERLINE",
  "tarifJournalier": 150.0,
  "statut": "LOUE"
}

### Lister tous les véhicules
GET http://localhost:8089/api/vehicules

### Consulter un véhicule
GET http://localhost:8089/api/vehicules/1

### Modifier un véhicule
PUT http://localhost:8089/api/vehicules/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "immatriculation": "123 TUN 4567",
  "marque": "Renault",
  "modele": "Clio",
  "categorie": "CITADINE",
  "tarifJournalier": 95.0,
  "statut": "LOUE"
}

### Supprimer un véhicule
DELETE http://localhost:8089/api/vehicules/1
